      "text": "Making a sentence kinder and making its meaning smaller are different things. In a work reply, a clear question can slip into a tentative suggestion, or a genuine reservation can become buried behind extra explanations until your position feels missing. When a message is softened simply to sound more agreeable, its central point can quietly vanish.",
